   "note": "PACIA/PACIB/PACDA/PACDB, AUTIA/AUTIB/AUTDA/AUTDB, Z-forms, XPACI/XPACD. PAC is a no-op; AUT/XPAC strip a field that is already canonical, so both become NOP. Z-forms with Rn != 31 are unallocated and stay untouched."
  },
  {
