      "at": [
       4,
       0
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
   "note": "PACGA -> MOVZ Xd,#0. Deterministic; any code that only compares PACGA results keeps working (0 == 0). RISK: code that treats a zero MAC as invalid, or uses the MAC as a hash. Fallback: --pacga=trap."
  },
